flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> IGR[intake_guard_router]

    IGR -->|terminal / direct / reject| RESP[response_subgraph]
    IGR -->|clarification_reply| MC[merge_clarification]
    IGR -->|local_life| US[understanding_subgraph]

    MC --> CPC[check_pending_clarification]
    CPC -->|restore| PS[planning_subgraph]
    CPC -->|topic_switch / pass / cancelled| US
    CPC -->|invalid / out_of_range / expired| RESP

    US --> SP[semantic_parse]
    SP --> SE[slot_extractor]
    SE --> FV[frame_validator]
    FV --> CR[context_recovery]
    CR --> GP[goal_planner]
    GP --> GR[goal_review]
    GR --> TR[target_resolve]
    TR --> CD[clarify_decide]
    CD -->|evidence_planner| EP[evidence_planner]
    CD -->|clarify| CL[clarify_response]
    CD -->|emit_response| EM[emit_response]

    GR -->|CLARIFY| CL
    GR -->|UNSUPPORTED_ANSWER| FB[fallback_answer]
    GR -->|FALLBACK| FB
    FV -->|error_code| CL
    SP -->|error_code| CL

    US -->|proceed| ORS[orchestration_router_shadow]
    US -->|clarify / fallback| RESP

    ORS --> WR[workflow_runner]

    WR -->|discovery_decision| PS
    WR -->|deterministic_tool| RESP
    WR -->|exploration_planning| RESP
    WR -->|direct_response| RESP
    WR -->|clarification_fallback| RESP

    EP --> PV[plan_validator]
    PV -->|tool_execute| TE[tool_execute]
    PV -->|fallback_answer| FB

    TE --> EB[evidence_build]
    EB --> EV[evidence_review]
    EV --> DP[decision_planner]
    DP --> DR[decision_review]

    DR -->|answer_plan_build| APB[answer_plan_build]
    DR -->|evidence_planner| EP
    DR -->|expand_search| XS[expand_search]
    DR -->|target_resolve| TR
    DR -->|fallback_answer| FB
    DR -->|clarify_response| CL
    DR -->|emit_response| EM

    EV -->|fallback_answer| FB
    EV -->|clarify_response| CL
    EV -->|evidence_planner| EP

    RESP -->|direct / reject| FRD[final_response_build]
    RESP -->|clarify| CL
    RESP -->|fallback| FB
    RESP -->|normal answer| APB

    APB --> AG[answer_generate]
    AG --> AV[answer_verify]
    AV -->|pass| FR[final_response_build]
    AV -->|rewrite| RW[rewrite]
    AV -->|fallback_answer| FB
    RW --> AG

    CL --> SUP[state_update_plan]
    FB --> SUP
    FRD --> SUP
    FR --> SUP

    SUP --> PS2[persist_session_state]
    PS2 --> EM2[emit_response]
    EM2 --> END([END])
